  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v.10.0.2\n- Feature: Added the \"BlazorWasmPrerenderingSkipNofollowLinks\" MSBuild property. When it is set to \"true\", the crawler no longer follows \"a\" links that have the rel=\"nofollow\" attribute. (Issue #53)\n- Fix: Resolved an issue where the browser tab title briefly changed and the styles added by \"HeadContent\" were briefly lost when a pre-rendered page started up.\n- Improve: Made each pre-rendered page contain only its own \"title\" element, so that search engines and link previews see the page title instead of the one in \"index.html\".\n- Fix: Resolved an issue where the last \"script\" element in the document was removed after the app started.\n\nTo see all the change logs, please visit the following URL.\n- https://github.com/jsakamoto/BlazorWasmPreRendering.Build/blob/master/RELEASE-NOTES.txt",
